claim.claim-text:
1. Positioning module characterized by comprising:
a wire which is unwound by an external force;
a length calculation unit calculating the unwinding length when the wire is unwound;
an angle calculation unit calculating the unwinding angle when the wire is unwound; and
a location information calculation unit calculating the location information of at least some points on the wire by using the unwinding length and the unwinding angle calculated.

8. Driving control device of carrier unit of claim 6, characterized in that:
the wire is electrically conductive;
the positioning module supplies power to the operator through the electrically conductive wire, and then the operator can control the travel of transport unit.

10. Driving control device of carrier unit of claim 6, characterized in that
the transport unit receives the user's operation signal which is input to a controller module through the wire;
travelling direction is controlled by the operation signal;
under the second travelling mode set by the operator.
